          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén dakwí un qaasaán, baraá kurko umuú heewo baraá shekeélír tame ar wák gan haniis as gadiyér doó Mungú.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.32",
