          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee as mikaáteedá' taa qaás as Mungú nee ilahhooár balaangw, nee ilahhooár da/a, nee ilahhooár deelór Sabaáto, nee ilahhooár Slahhángw /Abén, nee deelór uren ar hatlae, nee muruú hatlá' oo hhohhó', nee ilahhooa as hingeemisuú tlakweema as múk Israeli kuwa haraki/isi, nee gadiyedaá hatlá' sleémeero awa doó Munguúrén.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
