          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Puuruú geera, nee ilahhooarén, nee mamaá xaai, nee difaái nee di/ito in huwaán dír kaahamuuse baraá kutuwoó doó Munguúrén.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám baraá bu'ungwrene ar wák baraá mibango ngin huwaán dír múk tlahhoó Laáwi asma inooín gadiyeérír burumburiingw ngin tlehhitiyá' baraá ayeemoorene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó xwaylár Aroni dinkwa nee tlahhoó Laáwi ilahhooadár gár wák baraá mibaango ngin ilaoohiyá', naagáy múk tlahhoó Laáwi ar wák baraá muruú mibaango gan huuw baraá kutuwi, baraá kuuntáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma múk Israeli nee múk tlahhoó Laáwiwo ilahhooár balaangw ngin huwiyá', nee difaáiro, nee di/tá xaa'aá seituúni baraá kutwaydá' xooslaá hhohho' awa doó Mungú kiwa amohhe'eemisi, didá' kaahamuusér gadiyuus nee xuumuusér afér do'o nee daauuse i kutway'ín koná'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
